{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I need to understand the key points about commercial electricity tariffs in Kenya for my retail shop. Can you give me a plain summary of what I need to know?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm unable to provide you with a reliable summary of commercial electricity tariffs in Kenya based on the available information I have. The source material I'm working from doesn't contain substantive details about electricity tariff structures, rates, or how they apply to retail businesses. To get accurate information about commercial electricity tariffs for your shop, contact the Energy and Petroleum Regulatory Authority (EPRA) directly, or reach out to your local Kenya Power office—they can provide current tariff schedules and explain which rate category applies to your retail operation."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb5_digital_trade", "task_type": "summarization", "source_filename": "kplc_sme_commercial_tariffs_2025.txt", "source_text": "\"url\" rel=\"ugc external nofollow\">dr88us</a></b></div><div class=\"comment-metadata \"> <a href=\"https://contentgenics.com/commercial-electricity-tariffs-kenya-2025/#comment-5531\"><time datetime=\"2026-03-10T00:56:45+03:00\">March 10, 2026 at 12:56 am</time></a></div></div></div></footer><div class=\"comment-content\"><p>DR88US is alright if you&#8217;re after something a little different. They have a fair few games I hadn&#8217;t seen before. Worth a look if you&#8217;re bored of the same old. See wh"}}
