{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm confused about what digital trade regulations in Kenya mean for my small online business. Can you explain the key points I need to know?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I appreciate the question, but the source material I have available doesn't contain clear, substantive content about Kenya's digital trade regulations—it appears to be technical website markup rather than regulatory guidance. To give you accurate, actionable advice about digital trade requirements for your online business, I'd need access to the actual Kenya Revenue Authority or Ministry of Trade guidelines on this topic. I'd recommend contacting the Kenya National Trading Authority or visiting the KRA's digital services portal directly for current rules on online sales, registration, and tax obligations."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb5_digital_trade", "task_type": "summarization", "source_filename": "kplc_tiered_tariff_msme_guide.txt", "source_text": "ck-kubio-menu-items{width:100%}.wp-block-kubio-navigation-section{backface-visibility:hidden;position:relative;z-index:20}.wp-block-kubio-navigation{padding-left:inherit;padding-right:inherit}.wp-block-kubio-navigation [data-kubio]:not([class*=h-col-]),.wp-block-kubio-navigation.wp-block{max-width:unset!important}.wp-block-kubio-navigation__outer{position:relative}.entry-content>*{margin:clamp(1rem,.5em,2.5rem) auto clamp(1rem,.25em,2rem)}.entry-content>*{max-width:840px}.wp-block-kubio-post-fea"}}
