{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I need to understand the key rules around digital payments and online trade for my small business. What do I need to know?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm unable to provide you with accurate guidance on this topic based on the available source material. The content I have access to does not contain substantive information about digital payments, online trade regulations, or related compliance requirements for Kenyan MSMEs. To get the correct information, I recommend contacting the Kenya Revenue Authority (KRA) for tax-related digital commerce rules, or the Central Bank of Kenya for payment system regulations. You can also reach out to your local county trade office or the Kenya National Chamber of Commerce and Industry (KNCCI) for comprehensive guidance."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb5_digital_trade", "task_type": "summarization", "source_filename": "krb_strategic_plan.txt", "source_text": "bmit{border-radius:2px;} search-form{border-top-width:1px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-left-width:1px;border-right-width:1px;border-color:#ddd;border-radius:2px;}@media (min-width:922px){ ast-container{max-width:1140px;}}@media (min-width:993px){ ast-container{max-width:1140px;}}@media (min-width:1201px){ ast-container{max-width:1140px;}} comments-title{padding-bottom:0;}@media (max-width:921px){ ast-woocommerce-container{padding-top:1 ast-single-related-posts-container{padding-right:2 ast-sin"}}
