{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I run a small phone repair shop in Nairobi selling spare parts and fixing phones for customers. I also do some repairs for other small shops in the area. What digital trade or e-commerce rules should I be aware of?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm unable to provide specific guidance on this based on the information available to me. The source material provided does not contain substantive regulatory content about digital trade requirements, e-commerce obligations, or phone repair business rules in Kenya. To get accurate advice on whether you need business licensing, tax registration, consumer protection compliance, or data handling rules for your repair shop, I recommend contacting the Kenya Revenue Authority (KRA) for tax obligations, the Kenya Bureau of Standards (KEBS) for product standards on spare parts, and your county government for local business licensing requirements."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb5_digital_trade", "task_type": "analysis", "source_filename": "krb_organogram_functions.txt", "source_text": "#ffffff;--wp--preset--color--pale-pink: #f78da7;--wp--preset--color--vivid-red: #cf2e2e;--wp--preset--color--luminous-vivid-orange: #ff6900;--wp--preset--color--luminous-vivid-amber: #fcb900;--wp--preset--color--light-green-cyan: #7bdcb5;--wp--preset--color--vivid-green-cyan: #00d084;--wp--preset--color--pale-cyan-blue: #8ed1fc;--wp--preset--color--vivid-cyan-blue: #0693e3;--wp--preset--color--vivid-purple: #9b51e0;--wp--preset--color--ast-global-color-0: var(--ast-global-color-0);--wp--preset-"}}
