{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "What are the main digital and trade requirements I need to know about as a small business owner in Kenya?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I don't have sufficient regulatory content in the source material provided to give you a complete answer about digital and trade requirements for Kenyan MSMEs. The text fragment available doesn't contain substantive policy or regulatory guidance on this topic—it appears to be technical formatting code rather than actual regulatory content. To give you accurate guidance on your digital commerce obligations, tax registration, trade licensing, or other business requirements, I'd need to review the actual regulatory text. I recommend checking with the Kenya Revenue Authority (KRA) for tax obligations, your county's trade and business licensing office for permits, and the Communications Authority for any digital commerce requirements specific to your business type."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb5_digital_trade", "task_type": "summarization", "source_filename": "krb_organogram_functions.txt", "source_text": "th:922px){ ast-left-align-sub-menu:hover > footer-widget-area[data-section^=\"section-fb-html-\"] ast-builder-html-element{text-align:center;}blockquote,cite {font-style: initial;} wp-block-file {display: flex;align-items: center;flex-wrap: wrap;justify-content: space-between;} wp-block-pullquote {border: none;} wp-block-pullquote blockquote::before {content: \"\\201D\";font-family: \"Helvetica\",sans-serif;display: flex;transform: rotate( 180deg );font-size: 6rem;font-style: normal;line-height: 1;font"}}
