{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm starting a small retail shop in Nairobi and need to understand what county-level permits and geospatial requirements I have to deal with. Can you give me a step-by-step checklist of what I need to do?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I don't have specific regulatory content about county permits and geospatial requirements for retail businesses in the source material I'm working from right now. To give you an accurate checklist for your shop, I'd need access to current Nairobi County business licensing guidelines and geospatial zoning regulations. I recommend you contact your local Nairobi County Government office directly—they'll tell you exactly what permits you need, whether your location has any geospatial restrictions, and the application process. Your county's trade and investment office can also walk you through this quickly."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb6_county_geospatial", "task_type": "drafting", "source_filename": "kenya_sbdc_strathmore_msme_training.txt", "source_text": "ain-intrinsic-size:3000px 1500px} /*# sourceURL=wp-img-auto-sizes-contain-inline-css */ /*! This file is auto-generated */ wp-block-button__link{color:#fff;background-color:#32373c;border-radius:9999px;box-shadow:none;text-decoration:none;padding:calc( wp-block-file__button{background:#32373c;color:#fff;text-decoration:none} /*# sourceURL=/wp-includes/css/classic-themes css */ :root{--wp--preset--aspect-ratio--square: 1;--wp--preset--aspect-ratio--4-3: 4/3;--wp--preset--aspect-ratio--3-4: 3/4;--"}}
