{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm running a small retail shop in Nairobi's CBD and I'm planning to expand to a second location in Kiambu County next month. What county-level regulations or geospatial requirements do I need to be aware of before opening the new branch?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm unable to provide specific county-level or geospatial regulatory guidance based on the information available to me. To properly advise you on Nairobi and Kiambu County requirements for your retail expansion, I would need access to current county-specific business registration rules, zoning regulations, and location-based compliance requirements from those county governments. I recommend contacting the Nairobi County Business Licensing Office and the Kiambu County Trade Office directly to confirm what permits, approvals, and geospatial restrictions apply to your retail location in each county."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb6_county_geospatial", "task_type": "analysis", "source_filename": "kippra_nurturing_small_businesses.txt", "source_text": "g-rgb: 255, 178, 54; --color-warning-hover: #FFB236; --color-warning-active: #FFB236; --color-danger: #ff5062; --color-danger-rgb: 255, 80, 98; --color-danger-hover: #ff5062; --color-danger-active: #ff5062; --color-green: #30b570; --color-blue: #0073ff; --color-purple: #8557D3; --color-red: #ff5062; --color-muted: rgba(69, 89, 122, 0 6); --wpdm-font: \"Open Sans\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI"}}
